.TH "PACE WATCH" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace watch Manual"
.SH NAME
pace\-watch \- Poll a metric; trigger a hook when it...
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace watch
[OPTIONS] METRIC
.SH DESCRIPTION
Poll a metric; trigger a hook when it crosses a threshold.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-threshold\fP TEXT
Predicate like 'value < 20'.  [required]
.TP
\fB\-\-on\-cross\fP TEXT
Shell command to run on threshold crossing.  [required]
.TP
\fB\-i,\fP \-\-interval INTEGER
Poll interval in seconds (>=60).  [default: 300]
.TP
\fB\-\-once\fP
Poll once and exit (test mode).
